  (jv$clojure.core$attach-core-doc-meta! "clojure.core" "*unchecked-math*" "While bound to true, compilations of +, -, *, inc, dec and the\n  coercions will be done without overflow checks. While bound\n  to :warn-on-boxed, same behavior as true, and a warning is emitted\n  when compilation uses boxed math. Default: false." jolt-nil))
